## 1. bytes and FLOPs per read (16 rows) and per check (97 reads: 48 layers x 2 + the final mixer)
  weights per read: Wd 6.55 MB + Wu 6.55 + Wi 0.082 + w 0.020 = 13.21 MB bf16; per check 1.281 GB
  activation traffic per read (S4 chain), KB: h_in 328, block_out 82, hn_out 328, normed_out 328, normed_in_gemm_tiles 3604, partials 124, mix1 20, g_out 328, g_in 328, normed_in_tail 328, mixed_out 82; sum 5.88 MB (of it 3.60 MB are the 11 column tiles' re-reads of normed, cache-level)
  FLOPs per read 211.0 M (down + inject 106.2, up 104.9); per check 20.5 GFLOP
  byte floor per check at 258 GB/s: weights 4.97 ms; at 8 bits 2.48 ms
  byte floor per check at 284 GB/s: weights 4.51 ms; at 8 bits 2.26 ms
  byte floor per check at 294 GB/s: weights 4.36 ms; at 8 bits 2.18 ms

